                <pb facs="1010" n="916" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg916"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rockhill to Mr. Terrell.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-08-11"><hi rendition="#italic">August 11,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Sarkisder Havannessian received passport 19175 January 12, 1895; Mardiros
                    Simoonian, 19244, January 15. No record Hogop Pomgodjian or any similar name at
                    that time or since ninety-two.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rockhill</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
